  * Element flags for a member out of service, as the AMD driver records them
  * (rcblob): a member it fails on I/O errors gets 0x10
@@ -99,8 +112,19 @@
  * Of a RAID0 or Volume it keeps no 0x10 at all (@140018b80).
  */
